  "notes": "Original UK release in fully laminated sleeve.\nCardboard inner sleeve with rounded corners containing cartoons by Brian Gaynor and Viv.\nFirst cat.# on cover, 2nd on inner sleeve, 3rd on labels.\n\nThis version features the band members' silhouettes on both labels.\nThere is also a version [r14104763] with silhouettes on side A label only and another [r162244] without these silhouettes at all.\n\n℗ 1979 Island Records Ltd\n\nRunouts are stamped, except for \"SOUND CLINIC DREAD AT THE CONTROL\" and \"JoNZ AH IT DAT.\" that are etched.",
  "released_formatted": "07 Sep 1979",
